OL,3,GNEWSAMore NI bee colonies survived
OL,4,Awinter last year
OL,5,
OL,6,FAFBI entomologist Joanna Kirbas said
OL,7,Fthe survey was "essential" for
OL,8,Fmonitoring bee health and detecting
OL,9,Flong-term trends.
